#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_nfc
msgid "A 10-minute walkthrough that takes a blank NFC card from box to working in someone's hand."
msgstr "Desetominutni vodič koji praznu NFC karticu od kutije dovodi do ispravne kartice u nečijoj ruci."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_crm
msgid "A candidate needs <strong>≥ 25 points</strong> to surface. Top 3 per bucket are shown."
msgstr "Kandidat treba <strong>≥ 25 bodova</strong> da bi se prikazao. Prikazuju se prva 3 po grupi."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_automations
msgid "A common pattern: intro email goes out immediately (the formal touch), and a 5-minute Click to Chat panel surfaces (the informal \"let's talk now\" touch). Both are opt-in per card."
msgstr "Uobičajen obrazac: uvodni e-mail odlazi odmah (formalni kontakt), a 5-minutni panel Klik za chat se pojavljuje (neformalni kontakt \"hajde da razgovaramo odmah\"). Oboje se uključuje po vizitki."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_hub
msgid "A configurable lead form, optional reviews, and intro emails on first contact."
msgstr "Prilagodljiv obrazac za potencijale, opcionalni utisci i uvodni e-mailovi pri prvom kontaktu."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_nfc
msgid "A different OS (e.g., test on iOS if you wrote with Android, and vice versa)"
msgstr "Drugi operativni sistem (npr. testirajte na iOS-u ako ste upisivali sa Androidom, i obrnuto)"

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vcard_form_page
msgid ""
"A few minutes of setup.\n"
"              <em>A lifetime of introductions.</em>"
msgstr ""
"Nekoliko minuta podešavanja.\n"
"              <em>Cijeli život upoznavanja.</em>"

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_branding
msgid "A few surfaces are deliberately not rebrandable, by design or by Odoo constraint:"
msgstr "Nekoliko dijelova namjerno nije moguće prebrendirati, po dizajnu ili zbog ograničenja Odooa:"

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.nfc_onboarding_page
msgid "A free, trusted app that lets your phone write URLs to NFC cards. Pick your platform. Takes under a minute."
msgstr "Besplatna, pouzdana aplikacija pomoću koje vaš telefon upisuje URL-ove na NFC kartice. Odaberite svoju platformu. Traje manje od minute."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_reviews
msgid "A handful of approved reviews is more credible than a wall of them. Five strong reviews beat fifty mediocre ones."
msgstr "Nekoliko odobrenih utisaka je vjerodostojnije od cijelog zida utisaka. Pet jakih utisaka vrijedi više od pedeset osrednjih."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_nfc
msgid "A locked phone (NFC works on iOS even when locked, on most Androids too)"
msgstr "Zaključan telefon (NFC radi na iOS-u i kad je zaključan, a i na većini Android uređaja)"

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_crm
msgid "A new tenant on day one with sparse customer records sees a hint on every lead explaining what's missing."
msgstr "Novi zakupac prvog dana, sa malo podataka o kupcima, vidi napomenu na svakom potencijalu koja objašnjava šta nedostaje."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.bulk_onboarding_wizard
msgid "A sentence or two about the team. Recipients can override on their own card."
msgstr "Rečenica ili dvije o timu. Primaoci to mogu promijeniti na svojoj vizitki."

#. module: qr_code_odoo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qr_code_odoo.vinculum_guide_crm
msgid "A small <strong>Captured at: &lt;event&gt;</strong> badge appears under the lead's title in CRM, so anyone opening the lead immediately sees the source."
msgstr "Mala oznaka <strong>Prikupljeno na: &lt;event&gt;</strong> pojavljuje se ispod naslova potencijala u CRM-u, tako da svako ko otvori potencijal odmah vidi izvor."

